</test1>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B164101J02" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between the terminals of the vehicle side wire harness connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
